# 统一行尾：所有文本文件以 LF 存储与检出，避免 Windows 默认 autocrlf 造成跨平台行尾翻滚。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确标记为文本，确保即使误判也能归一化
*.go text
*.ts text
*.vue text
*.js text
*.json text
*.md text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.toml text
*.sql text
*.sh text
*.bat text
*.ps1 text

# 二进制资源：禁止行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
